{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36228","headline":"阳亭言事献漳州于使君 · 方干","name":"阳亭言事献漳州于使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重叠山前对酒罇，腾腾兀兀度朝昏。\n平明疎磬白云寺，遥夜孤砧红叶村。\n去鸟岂知烟树远，惊鱼应觉露荷翻。\n旅人寄食逢黄菊，每见故人思故园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}